Article 2 (Requirements for Designation of Specialized Biotechnology Policy Institutions) The Minister of Science and ICT may designate an institution or organization that meets all of the following requirements as a specialized biotechnology policy institution pursuant to Article 24 (1) of the Biotechnology Support Act:
1. Its business activities shall include affairs relating to support for biotechnology policies;
2. It shall have a dedicated organization capable of performing the affairs specified in the subparagraphs of Article 24 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Biotechnology Support Act, and at least seven dedicated personnel;
3. It shall have dedicated office space and facilities necessary to perform the affairs specified in the subparagraphs of Article 24 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Biotechnology Support Act.
